{
  "description": "The image shows a single quadrupedal animal in right-facing lateral view against a plain off-white background, standing with its body low to the ground and its back arched. The animal has an elongated head tapering to a blunt snout, a stout trunk, four thick limbs ending in large curved claws, and a long tapering tail extending behind the hind limbs to the right. Most of the dorsal surface, the top of the head, the outer sides of the limbs, and the tail are covered in overlapping dark brown to gray scales with lighter tan edges and fine striations. This scaly covering is interrupted by several large, irregular, pale pink, wrinkled, hairless patches of exposed skin on the mid-back, the mid-flank above the forelimb, and the lower rear/upper hind limb area. The ventral underbelly and lower limb skin is pale cream to pinkish with a wrinkled texture. The animal is standing on all four feet, with claws in contact with the ground and small dark speckles suggesting dirt on the lower legs and feet.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "elongated and narrow, tapering anteriorly to a blunt, rounded snout with a dark nostril at the tip and a few fine whiskers near the mouth; a small dark eye with fine lashes and wrinkled skin around it is on the side, the dorsal crown and snout top are covered in small overlapping scales, the lateral cheek and throat are pale gray-brown wrinkled skin",
      "where": "at the anterior right end of the body, projecting forward and slightly downward"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "one small, rounded, fleshy ear with a prominent inner ridge and a fringe of fine pale hairs around the margin, the interior is shadowed",
      "where": "on the side of the head just behind and slightly above the eye, at the edge of the scaly crown"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, columnar, muscular limbs; the upper portions are densely covered in overlapping dark scales, the lower portions are mostly pale pinkish-cream wrinkled skin with scattered small dark scales and dirt-like speckling",
      "where": "two forelimbs positioned under the chest/shoulder, two hindlimbs positioned under the rear, supporting the body above the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four broad feet with pale textured skin and three to four long, thick, dark brown to black, strongly curved claws on each foot that point forward and contact the ground",
      "where": "at the distal ends of each leg, in contact with the ground surface"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, tapering, slightly flattened tail covered dorsally in overlapping dark scales similar to the body, the ventral side less visible, the tip is pointed",
      "where": "extending posteriorly from the rear of the body behind the hind legs, lying along the ground and pointing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "numerous overlapping keratinous plates, rounded to slightly pointed, in shades of dark brown, charcoal gray and tan with lighter edges and fine radial striations, arranged in rows",
      "where": "covering the dorsal back, sides, top of head and snout, outer surfaces of the limbs, and the dorsal surface of the tail, surrounding the bare skin patches"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "large irregular patches of bare, pale pink to light cream, wrinkled, hairless skin with soft folds, contrasting sharply with the surrounding dark scales",
      "where": "one large patch on the mid-dorsal back, one on the mid-flank above the forelimb, and a cluster of smaller patches on the lower rear and upper hind limb area on the right side of the body"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "pangolin"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
